{
  "_comment": "Generated from data/case_tables dialogue CSV.",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "哟……又来一个问话的？我叫老范，跑了二十年船。这次是去武昌府的夜船。",
      "emotion": "evasive",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "你是船家？",
          "goto": "ask_route",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "这天气行船安全吗？",
          "goto": "ask_weather",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "船舱里那根铁撬棍是干什么用的？",
          "goto": "ask_cabin",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "你跑船二十年，应该攒了不少钱吧？",
          "goto": "ask_money",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "看看船舱里有什么",
          "goto": "observe_cabin",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_route": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_lao_fan_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "走东汊那条。快是快，就是……有暗礁。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "涨水的时候应该能过去。谁知道还露着。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "暗礁？你跑了二十年船，不知道有暗礁？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "知道……但客人催得急啊！",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_weather": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_lao_fan_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "这天气……说实话，不太好。但客人催得急。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "老头子跑了二十年船，什么天气没经历过？",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "他转了转手里的旱烟杆，没点着",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_cabin": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_lao_fan_talked",
        "cabin_saw_crowbar"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "铁撬棍？那是……那是修船用的。有时候船板松了，得敲敲打打。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "放在舱壁上，方便拿。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "修船用的……放了多久了？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "cold"
        },
        {
          "text": "……记不清了。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_money": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_lao_fan_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "嗐……跑船挣的是辛苦钱。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "这两年行情不好，客人少，价钱也压得低。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        },
        {
          "text": "他转了转手里的旱烟杆，没点着",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "辛苦钱……但至少是安稳钱。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "安稳？嘿嘿……安稳。",
          "speaker_id": "lao_fan_cabin",
          "emotion": "evasive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "observe_cabin": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_observed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "船舱不大，但收拾得还算干净。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "舱壁上挂着一根铁撬棍，旁边是蓑衣和斗笠。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "角落有几只木箱，用麻绳捆着。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "铁撬棍的位置有点奇怪——挂在舱壁正中间，像是特意放在那里的。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "这铁撬棍放得倒显眼……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
